@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Weather Station System

[*] --> Restart

state "Restart" as Restart
Restart : entry / system restarts from shut down condition
Restart : do / system begins running
Restart : exit / system is in running state

state "Running" as Running
Running : entry / system collects data when triggered by clock
Running : do / system runs normally
Running : exit / system performs an activity (data collection, summary preparation, or status checking)

state "Configuration Mode" as ConfigurationMode
ConfigurationMode : entry / system enters configuration mode for changes or power-saving settings
ConfigurationMode : do / user configures the system
ConfigurationMode : exit / system returns to running state

state "Data Collection" as DataCollection
DataCollection : entry / system collects data when triggered by clock while in running state
DataCollection : do / system collects data
DataCollection : exit / system returns to running state

state "Summary Preparation" as SummaryPreparation
SummaryPreparation : entry / system prepares and sends out a weather summary upon request
SummaryPreparation : do / system prepares summary
SummaryPreparation : exit / system returns to running state

state "Status Checking" as StatusChecking
StatusChecking : entry / system checks its own status and transmits the result upon request
StatusChecking : do / system checks status
StatusChecking : exit / system returns to running state

state "Controlled Mode" as ControlledMode
ControlledMode : entry / system moves into controlled mode through remote control
ControlledMode : do / user controls the system
ControlledMode : exit / system returns to running state or shut down condition

Restart --> Running
Running --> DataCollection
DataCollection --> SummaryPreparation
SummaryPreparation --> StatusChecking
StatusChecking --> Running
Running --> ConfigurationMode
ConfigurationMode --> Running
Running --> ControlledMode
ControlledMode --> Restart
Restart --> [*]
@enduml
